@AddsEats.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5187

### Get all restaurants (with optional pagination and filtering)
GET {{AddsEats.Api_HostAddress}}/api/restaurant?page=1&pageSize=10
Accept: application/json

###

### Get restaurant by ID
GET {{AddsEats.Api_HostAddress}}/api/restaurant/1
Accept: application/json

###

### Get menu of a specific restaurant
GET {{AddsEats.Api_HostAddress}}/api/restaurant/1/menu
Accept: application/json

###

### Get menu of non-existent restaurant (returns 404)
GET {{AddsEats.Api_HostAddress}}/api/restaurant/999/menu
Accept: application/json

###

### Get all menu items
GET {{AddsEats.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/menuitem
Accept: application/json

###

### Get menu item by ID
GET {{AddsEats.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/menuitem/1
Accept: application/json

###

### Create an Order (Success: 201 Created)
POST {{AddsEats.Api_HostAddress}}/api/order
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "restaurantId": 1,
  "menuItemId": 1,
  "customerName": "Abebe Bikila",
  "customerPhone": "+251911223344",
  "deliveryAddress": "Bole, Addis Ababa",
  "quantity": 2
}

###

### Create an Order - Validation Failure (400 Bad Request: missing fields, quantity 0)
POST {{AddsEats.Api_HostAddress}}/api/order
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "restaurantId": 0,
  "menuItemId": 0,
  "customerName": "",
  "customerPhone": "invalid-phone",
  "deliveryAddress": "",
  "quantity": 0
}

###

### Create an Order - Restaurant Not Found (404 Not Found)
POST {{AddsEats.Api_HostAddress}}/api/order
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "restaurantId": 9999,
  "menuItemId": 1,
  "customerName": "Abebe Bikila",
  "customerPhone": "+251911223344",
  "deliveryAddress": "Bole, Addis Ababa",
  "quantity": 1
}

###

### Create an Order - Inactive Restaurant (400 Bad Request)
POST {{AddsEats.Api_HostAddress}}/api/order
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "restaurantId": 2,
  "menuItemId": 4,
  "customerName": "Abebe Bikila",
  "customerPhone": "+251911223344",
  "deliveryAddress": "Ayat, Addis Ababa",
  "quantity": 1
}

###

### Create an Order - Menu Item Does Not Belong To Restaurant (400 Bad Request)
POST {{AddsEats.Api_HostAddress}}/api/order
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "restaurantId": 1,
  "menuItemId": 4,
  "customerName": "Abebe Bikila",
  "customerPhone": "+251911223344",
  "deliveryAddress": "Bole, Addis Ababa",
  "quantity": 1
}

###

### Get Order by ID (Success: 200 OK)
GET {{AddsEats.Api_HostAddress}}/api/order/1
Accept: application/json

###

### Get Non-Existent Order (404 Not Found)
GET {{AddsEats.Api_HostAddress}}/api/order/9999
Accept: application/json

###
